     "heading": {
      "zh-Hant": "海軍次官與艦隊司令",
      "en": "Vice-minister and fleet command"
     },
     "body": {
      "zh-Hant": "1933年他擔任軍縮會議全權委員，1934年任海軍次官。1936年任第三艦隊司令長官，1937年兼任支那方面艦隊司令長官，1938年轉任橫濱鎮台長官。",
      "en": "In 1933 he was a plenipotentiary to the disarmament conference and in 1934 became Navy Vice-Minister. He became commander-in-chief of the Third Fleet in 1936, concurrently led the China Area Fleet in 1937, and in 1938 became commandant of the Yokohama Chindai (as worded in the source)."
     },
