     "body": {
      "zh-Hant": "1940年他任軍事參議官並兼台灣總督，1944年再任軍事參議官；最終軍階為海軍大將，1970年去世。",
      "en": "In 1940 he became Supreme Military Councillor and Governor-General of Taiwan, in 1944 again served as Councillor; his final rank was admiral, and he died in 1970."
